Package: leakdown
Title: Shared pkgdown Theme for the guardedverse Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Selcuk", "Korkmaz", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "selcukorkmaz@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4632-6850"))
    )
Description: Provides the shared 'pkgdown' template, palette, and page furniture
    used by the guardedverse family of leakage-aware evaluation packages
    ('splitGraph', 'bioLeak', and 'fastml'). It carries no user-facing functions;
    it exists so that the package documentation sites share one visual identity
    and one set of cross-links without duplicating configuration.
